,&lt;br&gt;port discovery, tree cleanup" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dcfce7;strokeColor=#16a34a;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="720" y="215" width="270" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="s4" value="4 · Scene-aware Browser Agent&lt;br&gt;Playwright, DOM/ARIA; LLM reads&lt;br&gt;button labels; real hi-res capture" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dcfce7;strokeColor=#16a34a;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1060" y="215" width="270" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="svg" value="Backdrop (demo format)&lt;br&gt;auto · model draws · model picks&lt;br&gt;neutral animated motifs" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffedd5;strokeColor=#ea580c;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="380" y="390" width="270" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="clips" value="Real screen recording&lt;br&gt;sliced at clicks into&lt;br&gt;clips/scene_NN.mp4" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dcfce7;strokeColor=#16a34a;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1060" y="390" width="270" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="session" value="5 · Session store (out/sessions/&lt;id&gt;/)&lt;br&gt;manifest.json · clips/ · props.json" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ede9fe;strokeColor=#7c3aed;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1060" y="565" width="270" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="compose" value="6 · Compose (FFmpeg + Remotion)&lt;br&gt;Demo or Promo format&lt;br&gt;480p to 4K, no audio" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dcfce7;strokeColor=#16a34a;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="720" y="565" width="270" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="final" value="Final video&